  "description": "Frameless Avalonia window with a custom title bar and Linux distro inspired themes, plus themed controls: side menu, card, group box, chat, progress ring, progress bar, spinner, loading overlay, info bar, empty state, skeleton placeholders, breadcrumb, segmented control, tab view, ribbon, command palette, property grid, timeline, kanban board, code editor with syntax colors and line numbers, Visual Studio like docking layout (drag and drop with dock guides, tab groups, floating windows, auto hide), calendar / scheduler with month, week and day views, side by side and inline text diff, UML diagrams (all 14 kinds, read from and written to PlantUML), message / question dialogs with the system icons, toast notifications (info, success, warning, error), a Markdown view (CommonMark + GFM) with syntax colored code and Mermaid diagrams, and 23 chart controls (column, bar, line, area, pie, donut, radar, scatter, bubble, heatmap, pyramid, funnel, treemap, waterfall, gantt, histogram, bullet, gauge, diverging bar).",
